      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "HUBERT.\nA monk, I tell you, a resolved villain,\nWhose bowels suddenly burst out. The King\nYet speaks, and peradventure may recover.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
